                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      A fresh checkout of Avro cannot be compiled in eclipse due to tests relying on generated code.<br/>
<br/>
You can generate the needed code using ant, however eclipse still has issues due to the fact that the generated<br/>
code is not placed in a directory hierarchy that mimics the package structure of the generated class(es).<br/>
<br/>
I was able to resolve by copying the generated Test.java/Interop.java into a dir struct that mimics the <br/>
package struct, but otw I couldn&#39;t get Eclipse to compile the code fully.<br/>

  </td>
