</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Protocol and record definitions include a &quot;namespace&quot; specification.  Currently, when one is not specified, it defaults to null.  Rather, it should default to the namespace of the containing definition, if any.<br/>
<br/>
The specification document should probably also be updated to clarify that namespaces should use java package naming conventions, of a reversed domain name.<br/>

  </td>
