                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        AVRO-81                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      TestNG is a powerful test harness, which provides a lot of useful features like parallel test execution, test parametrization, and such.<br/>
Avro uses JUnit environment instead which is more rigid and less efficient.<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;d suggest to convert Avro&#39;s Junit based test infrastructure into TestNG controller environment, which will allow to achieve higher level of test execution control in the long run
  </td>
