                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When checking out the code from svn, the python script used for code generation is not executable.  This causes make, which invokes the script, to fail.<br/>
<br/>
This change will invoke it from python instead of from the shell (e.g. &quot;gen.py&quot; is now &quot;python gen.py&quot;).  <br/>
<br/>
Also in this patch, some of the README.txt notes were changed.
  </td>
