</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The java implementation currently generates JSON by hand.  Before default values this was okay, since Avro names do not permit characters that must be escaped.  But strings in default values must be properly escaped.  Using Jackson to generate JSON would guarantee proper escaping.  This would also simplify JSON generating code, making it easier to maintain.
  </td>
