                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The spec is silent on how to encode default values for &quot;fixed&quot; type in schema. The code in GenericDatumReader suggests that that it should be encoded as a JSON string with Java&#39;s platform default charset. A more appropriate way is to encode &quot;fixed&quot; in the same way as binary, that is a string with ISO-8859-1.<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;ll submit a patch for this soon.
  </td>
