                                            <td class="description">      Currently, the package name that you pass in to ReflectDatumReader needs to end with a dot. This should either be documented or the argument checking should be a bit more defensive. E.g. when you pass in new ReflectDatumReader(&quot;org.apache.avro&quot;), it&#39;ll try to instantiate objects like org.apache.avroFoo.
