                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      This patch has several fixes targeted to feedback from alpha users:<br/>
The code generator created some uncompilable code when a &quot;bytes&quot; type appears in a union.<br/>
The &quot;bytes&quot; parser template had a spurious &amp;.<br/>
Variable int reader bit shift was off by 1 bit.<br/>
Parser is set to print more verbose error messages and produce exceptions with these messages.<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>

