                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        AVRO-120                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      It is currently not possible to work with nested classes and the reflection API. Only the package and classname are recorded. The test case that I&#39;ll attach to this issues writes this as the schema: {&quot;type&quot;:&quot;record&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;BazRecord&quot;,&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;org.apache.avro&quot;,&quot;fields&quot;:[{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;nbr&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;int&quot;}]}, even though it is a nested class. The reader then tries to instantiate org.apache.avro.BazRecord, while it should instantiate org.apache.avro.TestDataFileReflect$BazRecord.
  </td>
