                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The release artifact includes the ivy jar, but no license file, notice, etc...<br/>
<br/>
I believe that you don&#39;t intend to ship this, but it snuck into the release based on it being in the lib directory? (esp since the build.xml will d/l the jar if it&#39;s missing)<br/>
<br/>
You probably just need to explicitly exclude it when building the release package (see ZooKeeper build.xml, I found the same issue there when moving to ivy)<br/>

