                <tr id="issuerow12436764" rel="12436764" data-issuekey="AVRO-127" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-127" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-127">AVRO-127</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                 Avro should support multiple schemas from the same AVRO file 
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Yang Yang
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Yang Yang
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 28/Sep/09 16:41 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 13/Dec/11 19:06 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 29/Sep/09 00:23 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        java            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      all systems
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      in our application, we often have to merge together all the day&#39;s data into one daily file,<br/>
data file schemas must be changing within the day, so we have different schemas within the same file.<br/>
<br/>
AVRO should support multiple schemas within the same file, ideally different schemas can be parsed out<br/>
to different children classes of the same schema class.<br/>
<br/>
		
  </td>
