</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The current Java HTTP server API forces one to launch a new HTTP server on a new port for each protocol.  Rather it should permit folks to add an RPC service to an existing Java HTTP server.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
