</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Setup: Generate a schema from an existing type and try to serialize an object from that type. The type itself should have a member x that itself is serialized as record. The type x may contain simpler members e.g. ints. If x is left equal to null, a NullPointerException is thrown when trying to serialize the object to json.<br/>
<br/>
Test to reproduce the problem and my tiny fix attached.
  </td>
