    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 14/Oct/09 01:01 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 01/Mar/10 17:09 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 15/Oct/09 15:47 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.3.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        c++            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I used autoconf to create a configure file, which in turn can be used to create a Makefile.<br/>
<br/>
This is to replace the hand-edited System.mk files that were there before, as now configure tries to figure it out.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
