                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Patch that follows gives command-line access to ReflectData&#39;s getSchema() API, which creates an AVRO schema based on reflection.<br/>
<br/>
Here&#39;s an example:<br/>
<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
   $ src/scripts/avroj.sh induce build/test/classes org.apache.avro.BarRecord<br/>
    {&quot;type&quot;:&quot;record&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;BarRecord&quot;,&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;org.apache.avro&quot;,&quot;fields&quot;:[{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;beerMsg&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;string&quot;}]}<br/>
{noformat}
  </td>
