                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Originally part of AVRO-152, this introduces getStringOptional and getStringRequired helper methods, to facilitate throwing meaningful exceptions when something&#39;s wrong with a schema.<br/>
<br/>
There aren&#39;t tests that bad schemas fail the validation in the expected ways, but this did trigger a test which had a fixed field of size 0, which makes no sense; that has been fixed.<br/>
<br/>
Where it was immediately adjacent, I&#39;ve fixed brace-less if&#39;s according to the style guide (http://java.sun.com/docs/codeconv/html/CodeConventions.doc6.html#449).
  </td>
