                                            <td class="description">      Originally part of AVRO-152, the patch that follows has SpecificCompiler write to Strings; it writes those strings to files separately.  The motivation behind this was to be able to look at the generated file contents without dealing with files.<br/>
<br/>
This patch also adds tests for some of the helper methods, adds tests that a few schemas generate code fine, and adds a line in TestSchema that makes sure that every schema that test sees can generate code just fine.
