                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      This patch was inspired by feedback I&#39;ve received from Thiru.  Thanks Thiru!<br/>
<br/>
This patch makes two interface changes:<br/>
<br/>
1. It splits avro_io into avro_io_reader and avro_io_writer<br/>
2. It splits avro_channel into avro_reader and avro_writer<br/>
<br/>
It also includes an update to the README and configure asciiart.  
