                                            <td class="description">      This is an incremental feature that is needed for schema resolution.  Given a name of a record or enum symbol, we must be able to know if it exists, and if so, what is its ordinal in the schema.  This adds the API for it.  Also, with this feature it checks for, and ensures that, all names or symbols are unique in a record or enum.<br/>

