                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The protocol declaration section of the spec has<br/>
<br/>
----<br/>
A protocol is a JSON object with the following attributes:<br/>
<br/>
    * name, string, to distinguish it from other protocols;<br/>
----<br/>
<br/>
while the subsequent example lists &quot;protocol&quot; (and the code afaict).<br/>
<br/>
also the spec makes no mention of which attributes are required and which are optional (and what the defaults<br/>
are if not specified).
