                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      For records/enums/etc... with names that begin with lower case letters:<br/>
<br/>
      &quot;response&quot;: {&quot;name&quot;:&quot;e1&quot;, &quot;type&quot;:&quot;enum&quot;, &quot;symbols&quot;:[&quot;AA&quot;, &quot;BB&quot;]},<br/>
<br/>
generates an E1.java file<br/>
<br/>
public enum e1 { <br/>
  AA, BB<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
which fails to compile under javac - which complains that the class name is e1 but the java file name of E1.java does not match.
