                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently the file readers and writers just read enough to cover the requested length. In order to minimize reads they have been updated to use buffers. This patch also changes the return values to match typical read/write semantics. They now read as much as possible and return the number of bytes read/written or -1 on error. 
