                <tr id="issuerow12441264" rel="12441264" data-issuekey="AVRO-227" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-227" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-227">AVRO-227</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Spec example for record serialization is incorrect
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Todd Lipcon
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Todd Lipcon
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Todd Lipcon
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 20/Nov/09 06:07 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 01/Mar/10 17:09 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 20/Nov/09 23:12 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.3.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        spec            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      {quote}<br/>
An instance of this record whose a field has value 27 (encoded as hex 36) and whose b field has value &quot;foo&quot; (encoded as hex bytes OC 66 6f 6f), would be encoded simply as the concatenation of these ...<br/>
{quote}<br/>
but &quot;foo&quot; should be encoded as zigzag(3) followed by &quot;foo&quot;. zigzag(3) is 0x06, not 0x0c
  </td>
