                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The following patch amends the Tool interface to have names and descriptions, as well as supporting specifying what input and output streams to use.  The former is handy for printing a list of options, and the latter is useful for writing tests.  (The test that uses it is going to show up in a separate JIRA.)<br/>
