                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      BSON has a nice implementation of __len__:<br/>
<br/>
&gt;&gt;&gt; from pymongo.bson import BSON<br/>
&gt;&gt;&gt; len(BSON.from_dict({&quot;hello&quot;: &quot;world&quot;}))<br/>
22<br/>
<br/>
We should too!
