</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                For Python 2.6 and above, use &quot;json&quot; module from stdlib instead of simplejson
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
