                <tr id="issuerow12443782" rel="12443782" data-issuekey="AVRO-259" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-259" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-259">AVRO-259</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                GenericData.Array should fail fast when constructed with a null Schema
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Trivial
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Kevin Oliver
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Kevin Oliver
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Kevin Oliver
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 18/Dec/09 17:14 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 01/Mar/10 17:09 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 09/Jan/10 00:03 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.3.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        java            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      GenericData.Array&#39;s constructor takes a Schema but doesn&#39;t validate that it is not null. The schema is assumed to be not null in other places (equals() and hashCode()) which then trigger NPEs. 
