                <tr id="issuerow12444332" rel="12444332" data-issuekey="AVRO-267" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-267" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-267">AVRO-267</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Tool (for &quot;avroj&quot;) to send and receive a single RPC from the commandline
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Philip Zeyliger
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Philip Zeyliger
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Philip Zeyliger
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 29/Dec/09 21:01 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 01/Mar/10 17:09 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 31/Dec/09 21:55 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.3.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        java            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Vaguely similar to &quot;netcat&quot; and &quot;netcat -l&quot;, &quot;avroj rpcreceive&quot; and &quot;avroj rpcsend&quot; would send receive or send a single RPC (using the HTTP transport).  The former is required to have a response pre-determined and echoes the request; the latter echoes any response it receives.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
