                                            <td class="description">      For testing (both Avro itself, and code that uses<br/>
Avro servers) it&#39;s sometimes handy to connect the RPCs without<br/>
even a socket. This implementation of a Transceiver does just that.<br/>
(This can, for users, both avoid the overhead of using sockets, and,<br/>
in debugging, let users see stack traces that have both client<br/>
and server code in one thread.)
  </td>
