                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;d like to make some improvements to Avro&#39;s java tools prior to the 1.3 release, in particular:<br/>
 - rename the jar from avroj.jar to avro-tools.jar.  the avroj name seemed good when this was a shell script, but, as a jar it should perhaps be named consistently with other jars.<br/>
 - fix the build to copy the jar file to the top-level dist directory, for inclusion in releases<br/>
 - make the help command print the version and a link to the apache license<br/>
 - include the Apache license and notice files in the jar<br/>

  </td>
