                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      This patch adds a new function <br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
int schema_datum_validate (avro_schema_t expected_schema, avro_datum_t datum);<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
which validates a datum against a schema.  Having this function will allow me to start on the datum write path.<br/>
<br/>
This patch also includes minor documentation updates, code cleanup, and changes all double tail queue macros to single tail queue.
