                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      No one likes the name genavro. Let&#39;s rename to one of these:<br/>
- AvroIDL (Interface Description Language)<br/>
- AvroHDL (Highlevel Description Language)<br/>
- AvroDL (Description Language)<br/>
<br/>
The abbreviation IDL might conjure up CORBA nightmares for people. Thoughts?<br/>

  </td>
