                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      We&#39;d like it when EOF is encountered between objects to throw EOFException, while EOF encountered within an object to throw AvroTypeException.  I think this was working, but it&#39;s not working at present.  The following command fails:<br/>
<br/>
echo &#39;{&quot;greeting&quot;:&quot;Hello World!&quot;}&#39; | java -jar build/avro-tools-1.2.0-dev.jar fromjson &#39;{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;record&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;hello&quot;,&quot;fields&quot;:[{&quot;name&quot;: &quot;greeting&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;}]}&#39; -<br/>

