</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                After a fresh &#39;build.sh test&#39; svn reports certain files modified in Ubuntu 9.10
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Scott Banachowski
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Thiruvalluvan M. G.
    </td>
