                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The new file format in AVRO-160 limits a few use cases that I have found to be important.<br/>
<br/>
A block currently contains a count of the number of records, the block data, and a sync marker.  <br/>
This change would add the block size, in bytes, along side the number of records.   <br/>
<br/>
This allows efficient access to a block&#39;s data without the need to decode the data into individual Datums, which is useful for various use cases.  
  </td>
