                <tr id="issuerow12446834" rel="12446834" data-issuekey="AVRO-383" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-383" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-383">AVRO-383</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Optimizing ResolvingDecoder for default values
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Thiruvalluvan M. G.
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Thiruvalluvan M. G.
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Thiruvalluvan M. G.
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 27/Jan/10 17:22 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 01/Mar/10 17:09 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 02/Feb/10 05:07 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.3.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        java            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When the reader&#39;s and writer&#39;s schemas are records and the reader&#39;s schema has a field with default value and the writer&#39;s schema doesn&#39;t have the field, the ResolvingDecoder keeps the default value in a byte array. This byte array is in Json format. Moving this to Avro binary format improves performance.<br/>
<br/>
Apply the test patch and try &quot;Perf -M&quot;. Then apply the patch and run it again. On my machine, the performance is three times the original.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
