                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      While config.h is generated, it is only included from within st.c to make some things work correctly within st.h.<br/>
<br/>
I would suggest changing things a little:<br/>
<br/>
* Put an include of config.h into src/avro_private.h<br/>
* Include avro_private.h into all .c files.<br/>
* Not sure if the values from config.h are needed in any of the tests or examples ... I would hope not though and that this is fully insulated from being visible within anything exposed by avro.h.<br/>
<br/>
Given some feedback, I can readily prepare a patch.<br/>

  </td>
