                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The various &#39;dist&#39; target implementations don&#39;t consistently checksum targets, and none sign them.  Before distribution on Apache servers, all artifacts must be signed.<br/>
<br/>
We should add a new command, &#39;sign&#39; that signs and checksums all artifacts in dist/.  And we should remove all the existing per-language checksumming code.<br/>

  </td>
