                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Patch coming shortly.<br/>
<br/>
This is a bit of a change since we&#39;d now recommend that users always call this at startup / shutdown ... not sure of the best way to handle that for people that don&#39;t.<br/>
<br/>
I guess that&#39;d make this a change for 1.4?<br/>
<br/>
My subsequent changes will depend on this (memory allocation routing and atom table).<br/>

