</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                make check in c++ is broken because of typo &amp; missing boost_filesystem library
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            John Plevyak
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            John Plevyak
    </td>
