  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      &quot;make check&quot; in c++ is broken because of typo &amp; missing boost_filesystem library.<br/>
<br/>
The typo is inverting BOOST and HAVE in api/buffer/detail/BufferDetailIterator.hh <br/>
<br/>
-#ifdef BOOST_HAVE_ASIO<br/>
+#ifdef HAVE_BOOST_ASIO<br/>
<br/>
The missing library requires adding a new m4 macro.<br/>
<br/>
I will include a patch.
  </td>
