                                            <td class="description">      While it is OK to use array in avro response, we get the following error when using it in the type definition. e.g.:<br/>
<br/>
  {<br/>
    &quot;namespace&quot;: &quot;my_namespace&quot;,<br/>
    &quot;protocol&quot;: &quot;MyProtocol&quot;,<br/>
    &quot;types&quot;: [<br/>
      {<br/>
        &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Thing&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;record&quot;, &quot;fields&quot;: [<br/>
          { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;id&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;long&quot; },<br/>
          { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;other_ids&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;array&quot;, &quot;items&quot;: &quot;long&quot; }<br/>
...<br/>
<br/>
