                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Reasons to switch to YAJL:<br/>
 * Already supports intercepting / replacing the memory allocator.<br/>
 * Already ported to Win32<br/>
 * Uses CMake already<br/>
<br/>
I think it also addresses a bug that we currently have in terms of compliance with the spec since Jansson can&#39;t return anything other than a dictionary or list from a JSON parse, but I don&#39;t recall for sure what that was.<br/>

