                <tr id="issuerow12467245" rel="12467245" data-issuekey="AVRO-581" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-581" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-581">AVRO-581</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                java: add reducer that separates keys and values when map output is pairs
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Doug Cutting
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Doug Cutting
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Doug Cutting
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 17/Jun/10 17:40 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 08/Sep/10 21:07 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 21/Jul/10 21:20 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.4.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        java            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        AVRO-580,                                                AVRO-513                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      We should add a Pair&lt;K,V&gt; class, implementing SpecificRecord, that combines instances of two schemas (specific or generic).  Pairs would be compared by key, ignoring value.  The template for its schema would be:<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
{&quot;type&quot;: &quot;record&quot;, &quot;name&quot;: &quot;org.apache.avro.mapred.Pair&quot;, &quot;fields&quot;:[<br/>
  {&quot;name&quot;: &quot;key&quot;, &quot;type&quot;:&quot; &lt;&lt;insert key schema here&gt;&gt;},<br/>
  {&quot;name&quot;: &quot;value&quot;, &quot;order&quot;: &quot;ignore&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &lt;&lt;insert value schema&gt;&gt;}<br/>
]}<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
When map outputs are instances of this class, a reducer may be used whose reduce method is something like:<br/>
<br/>
public abstract void reduce(K key, Iterable&lt;V&gt; values);
  </td>
