</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Bad error message if you try and name an array or a map: org.apache.avro.SchemaParseException: Undefined name: &quot;map&quot;
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
