                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Error message should be something like &quot;You can&#39;t name a map&quot;<br/>
<br/>
Broken schema:<br/>
{<br/>
  &quot;name&quot;:&quot;annoyance&quot;,<br/>
  &quot;type&quot;:&quot;record&quot;,<br/>
  &quot;fields&quot;:[<br/>
    {<br/>
      &quot;name&quot;:&quot;mymap&quot;,<br/>
      &quot;type&quot;:&quot;map&quot;,<br/>
      &quot;values&quot;:&quot;string&quot;<br/>
    }<br/>
  ]<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
Error:<br/>
<br/>
org.apache.avro.SchemaParseException: Undefined name: &quot;map&quot;<br/>
	at org.apache.avro.Schema.parse(Schema.java:876)<br/>
	at org.apache.avro.Schema.parse(Schema.java:912)<br/>
	at org.apache.avro.Schema.parse(Schema.java:796)<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
