</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      As described on the dev mailing list (http://mail-archives.apache.org/mod_mbox/avro-dev/201007.mbox/browser), the NettyServer constructor fires off a thread to perform initialization, leaving the server in an unusable state for an indeterminate amount of time.<br/>
<br/>
Suggested fix is to perform all initialization eagerly in the ctor.
  </td>
