                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;ve developed a PHP library for Avro against the Avro 1.3.3 spec as part<br/>
of using Avro at myYearbook.com. It&#39;s based on the Python and Ruby<br/>
libraries. Current functionality includes schema parsing, Avro data file and<br/>
string IO.<br/>
<br/>
Known issues:<br/>
 - Support for field defaults is incomplete.<br/>
 - Lacks RPC and protocol support, JSON encoding, and deflate codec.<br/>

  </td>
