                <tr id="issuerow12473535" rel="12473535" data-issuekey="AVRO-659" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-659" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-659">AVRO-659</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Portable specification of the location of schema and protocol files
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Jeff Hammerbacher
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Jeff Hammerbacher
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 08/Sep/10 06:49 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 13/Dec/11 19:06 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        java            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Avro doesn&#39;t require code generation, which is great. However, if you want to use a protocol or a schema, your code needs to know where to find it. When your code is ported to new systems, the protocol or schema file must be placed in the same place as on the previous system for things to work correctly.<br/>
<br/>
For importing modules in a portable fashion, Python provides a default set of places it will look for modules and an environment variable called PYTHONPATH that programs can use to override these defaults. It may be useful to explore similar constructs for Avro implementations that don&#39;t do code generation. 
  </td>
