                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      avro.io has a validate method that currently occupies around half the time it takes to serialize a fairly complex record through a datafile.  validate() gets called repeatedly during an object&#39;s traversal, even though validate itself is already recursive.  This introduces combinatorially excessive validation that has a significant impact on the performance of serializing complex records.
