                <tr id="issuerow12475543" rel="12475543" data-issuekey="AVRO-675" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-675" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-675">AVRO-675</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Bytes and fixed setters don&#39;t update datum size
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Douglas Creager
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Douglas Creager
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Douglas Creager
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 30/Sep/10 21:00 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 12/Mar/11 00:32 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 05/Oct/10 22:57 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.4.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.5.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        c            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate">900</td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate">900</td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">            0%
    </td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The setter methods for bytes and fixed datum instances don&#39;t update the size field.  So, for instance, if you create a datum:<br/>
<br/>
{{avro_datum_t  datum = avro_wrapbytes(NULL, 0);}}<br/>
<br/>
Then later you update that datum to point to a different buffer:<br/>
<br/>
{{avro_wrapbytes_set(datum, &quot;hello&quot;, 5);}}<br/>
<br/>
If you write that datum out to a file, you&#39;ll get a zero-length value in the output, since the size pointer didn&#39;t get updated from 0 to 5.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     0%
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     0%
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate">900</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate">900</td>
