                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The attached patch adds type information to the static factory methods in the SpecificRequestor and ReflectRequestor to avoid the necessity of casting the proxy. <br/>
<br/>
TestNamespace proxy = (TestNamespace)SpecificRequestor.getClient(TestNamespace.class, client);<br/>
<br/>
becomes<br/>
<br/>
TestNamespace proxy = SpecificRequestor.getClient(TestNamespace.class, client);
  </td>
