                                            <td class="environment">      Linux 2.6.32-25-generic 
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;m seeing an issue with a clean build (ant clean dist) where the Initialization of the VelocityEngine in the SpecificCompiler fails. Its trying to obtain a Servlet context for the default ServletLogChute. Configuring the engine to use the NullLogChute fixes the issue.<br/>
<br/>
    velocityEngine.setProperty(&quot;runtime.log.logsystem.class&quot;, <br/>
    	&quot;org.apache.velocity.runtime.log.NullLogChute&quot;);<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
