                <tr id="issuerow12494282" rel="12494282" data-issuekey="AVRO-722" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-722" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-722">AVRO-722</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                IPC Request Metadata written for transmission before processing by plugins
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Stephen Gargan
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Stephen Gargan
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Stephen Gargan
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 30/Dec/10 00:21 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 12/Mar/11 00:32 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 07/Jan/11 18:00 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.5.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.5.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        java            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      There is a small issue with the processing  order of request metadata in an IPC call. The map is written for transmission before the context is passed to plugins for processing and as a result any changes that client plugins make to the metadata will not get transferred as the empty map has already been written.<br/>
<br/>
Also when the response metadata is read back in it is mistakenly read into the context&#39;s request metadata instead of the response metadata. The attached patch has fixes for both of these issues.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
