                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;ve created a patch that adds a new avro_schema_get_subschema function.  This provides a single function for returning the named subschema, without having to worry about which particular schema type you have.  It turns NULL if the named subschema doesn&#39;t exist, or if the schema doesn&#39;t support subschemas.
  </td>
