  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Trying to build avro-java from svn trunk fails in checkstyle:<br/>
<br/>
&quot;Unused import - org.apache.avro.UnresolvedUnionException&quot; in<br/>
ipc\src\main\java\org\apache\avro\specific\SpecificResponder.java<br/>
<br/>
I had to run with -Dcheckstyle.skip=true to get anywhere. Maybe consider running checkstyle only on demand or on the build server (set &quot;skip&quot; property from default false to true in the pom and pass skip=false to enable when required).<br/>

