                                            <td class="description">      This is a problem if one is trying to reuse the BinaryEncoder by passing a new OutputStream with the init() method. While the encoder will write all the fields to the new OutputStream, fields that are of type &quot;bytes&quot; do not get written. This effectively means that one needs to create a new BinaryEncoder each time if one is serializing record with a &quot;bytes&quot; field in it.
