                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        AVRO-650                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      AVRO-650 introduced a large performance regression and memory bloat issue with GenericDatumReader.<br/>
<br/>
Performance plummets for some Perf.java tests (One test took 1 hour to finish on my laptop).<br/>
Some minor changes I tried result in it passing in shorter time, but with still an 80% performance degredation.<br/>
<br/>
This is associated with memory bloat related to ThreadLocals.<br/>
<br/>
More details provided in comments.
  </td>
