                <tr id="issuerow12498172" rel="12498172" data-issuekey="AVRO-761" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-761" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-761">AVRO-761</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Requestor sends protocol text on each handshake under certain circumstances
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Doug Cutting
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Richard Ahrens
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Richard Ahrens
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 09/Feb/11 20:28 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 12/Mar/11 00:32 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 08/Mar/11 01:02 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.4.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.5.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        java            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When using a stateless transport such as HTTP and different protocol versions on client and server, Requestor will send the local protocol text on each request once a handshake match is established.  For large protocols, this slows things down considerably.  The attached patch resolves the issue by resetting the sendLocalText field after a successful handshake.
  </td>
