                                            <td class="description">      The Avro IDL compiler should support the inline documentation features of Avro. This is already implemented in the Avro protocol specification as the &quot;doc&quot; field, however there is no documented feature in Avro IDL for supporting this.<br/>
<br/>
I suggest using a style similar to Javadocs, where /** */ is used to represent doc comments.
