                                            <td class="description">      Schema metadata (i.e. non-avro metadata) must be retained in the string serialization (toString) of Schema. The forthcoming patch adds a test to TestSchema that ensures this retention. Basically, it tests for the invariant:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;code&gt;<br/>
assertEquals(schema, Schema.parse(schema.toString()));<br/>
&lt;/code&gt;
