                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently, avro-tools.jar for 1.5.0 contains both avro specific tools classes from org.apache.avro.tool and many external dependencies like org.slf4j.impl. The problem is that if i define my own logback impl for slf4j in my pom, it conflicts with the org.slf4j.impl.StaticLoggerBinder.class in avro-tools. It would be better to split it to two jars: one only contains avro specific tools, and another one only contains external dependencies
