	at org.apache.hadoop.mapred.Child.main(Child.java:234)<br/>
=====================================================================================================<br/>
<br/>
The signature of our map() is:<br/>
<br/>
public void map(Utf8 input, AvroCollector&lt;Pair&lt;Utf8, GenericRecord&gt;&gt; collector, Reporter reporter) throws IOException;<br/>
<br/>
and reduce() is:<br/>
<br/>
public void reduce(Utf8 key, Iterable&lt;GenericRecord&gt; values, AvroCollector&lt;GenericRecord&gt; collector, Reporter reporter) throws IOException;<br/>
<br/>
All the GenericRecords are of the same schema.<br/>
<br/>
There are many changes in the area of serialization/de-serailization between avro 1.4 and 1.5, but could not figure out why the exceptions were generated. 
