    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-793" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-793">AVRO-793</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                A strange problem when I am trying to read avro record with a subset of the schema.
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Critical
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
