                <tr id="issuerow12507176" rel="12507176" data-issuekey="AVRO-820" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-820" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-820">AVRO-820</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Java: Exceptions thrown while encoding a record while writing an Avro Data file will produce a corrupt file. 
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Critical
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Scott Carey
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Scott Carey
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Scott Carey
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 13/May/11 20:31 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 12/Aug/11 20:22 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 19/May/11 15:53 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.4.1,                     1.5.0,                     1.5.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.5.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        java            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If an exception is thrown while serializing a record in DataFileWriter&lt;D&gt;.append(D) partial contents of that serialization will end up in the file.  This corrupts the block.  <br/>
<br/>
DataFileWriter should ensure that the buffer is rewound to the state prior to the record write in the case of an exception thrown during serialization to prevent creating a corrupt file.
  </td>
