                <tr id="issuerow12513041" rel="12513041" data-issuekey="AVRO-853" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-853" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-853">AVRO-853</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Cache hash codes in Schema and Field
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Doug Cutting
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Douglas Kaminsky
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Douglas Kaminsky
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 06/Jul/11 21:38 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 01/Nov/11 18:36 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 12/Aug/11 21:54 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.5.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.6.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        java            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      We are experiencing a serious performance degradation when trying to store/retrieve fields and schemas in hash-based data structures (eg. HashMap). Since all fields and schemas are immutable (with the exception of RecordSchema allowing deferred setting of Fields) it makes sense to cache the hash code on the object instead of recalculating every time the hashCode method gets called. <br/>
<br/>
(Are there other mutable Schema sub-types that I&#39;m not thinking about?)
  </td>
