                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      There have been a couple of releases on the Jansson JSON library that we&#39;re using in the C bindings.  There are a couple of new features that will be especially helpful to us:<br/>
<br/>
 * Jansson now supports 64-bit integer values, so Avro {{long}} values will encode correctly<br/>
 * Jansson can now encode JSON values that aren&#39;t top-level arrays or objects, so we won&#39;t need a special workaround for encoding Avro scalars
  </td>
