</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      CMakeLists.txt incorrectly specifies local/lib and local/include as destinations for install. Since prefix is /usr/local by default, this installs headers and libraries under /usr/local/local. It also makes it impossible to install under /usr or /opt (e.g. MacPorts on OS X).
