                <tr id="issuerow12525735" rel="12525735" data-issuekey="AVRO-906" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-906" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-906">AVRO-906</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Inconsistent ordering of field props 
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Doug Cutting
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Douglas Kaminsky
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Douglas Kaminsky
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 04/Oct/11 21:16 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 01/Nov/11 18:36 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 05/Oct/11 18:11 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.6.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        java            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When a schema/protocol is written and read back in (see attached example) via Protocol.parse, the field ordering is not guaranteed to be preserved because the &quot;Props&quot; object extends HashMap, which has no ordering contract.<br/>
<br/>
Recommend switching to a Map implementation with an ordering guarantee.<br/>
<br/>
(Identified in Avro 1.5.1 - please verify against 1.5.4)<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
