                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The {{avro_wrapped_buffer_t}} is used by the bytes and string types to store the content of the Avro value.  The wrapped buffer interface is capable of being zero-copy, where the underlying content buffer is shared across multiple Avro values.  But our default implementation would create a new physical copy of the data every time the {{copy}} method is called.  It would be good to have a default zero-copy implementation.
