                                            <td class="description">      Google&#39;s Guava libraries include an optimized implementation of lexicographic byte comparison based on sun.misc.Unsafe that&#39;s ~4x faster than the normal Java implementation.<br/>
<br/>
http://hiroshiyamauchi.blogspot.com/2010/08/fast-unsigned-byte-lexicographical.html<br/>
http://www.google.com/codesearch#UKMs0lhE9bg/trunk/src/com/google/common/primitives/UnsignedBytes.java&amp;l=276<br/>
<br/>
