                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The DatumReader API is meant to be thread-safe, in that many threads should be able to simultaneously use a single DatumReader instance.  When we first switched GenericDatumReader to use a resolver thread-safety was broken.  AVRO-650 repaired this with a thread-local resolver cache, but performance suffered. AVRO-743 improved performance for single-threaded applications, but multi-threaded performance is still poor.
  </td>
