                <tr id="issuerow12534804" rel="12534804" data-issuekey="AVRO-976" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-976" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-976">AVRO-976</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                NettyServer: enable use of an ExecutionHandler
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Bruno Dumon
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Bruno Dumon
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Bruno Dumon
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 12/Dec/11 16:30 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 15/Feb/12 00:46 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 13/Dec/11 00:12 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.6.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        java            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        AVRO-1001,                                                AVRO-1019                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I noticed that when using a multi-threaded netty-based avro client, the server was only processing one request at a time. This is a problem if processing the request takes time (io wait).<br/>
<br/>
The solution Netty provides is the ExecutionHandler:<br/>
http://docs.jboss.org/netty/3.2/api/org/jboss/netty/handler/execution/ExecutionHandler.html<br/>
<br/>
I will attach a patch which allows the user to provide, optionally, such an ExecutionHandler, which is then inserted into the Netty pipeline.
  </td>
