                                            <td class="description">      It would be really nice to be able to use Avro inside OSGi. To achieve this two things are required:<br/>
i) Provide proper MANIFEST.MF.<br/>
ii) Deal with potential class loading issues. Avro uses Class.forName a lot and that is not very OSGi friendly.<br/>
<br/>

