  useful new feature: (http://mail-archives.apache.org/mod_mbox/maven-announce/201111.mbox/%3C15365449.01320142181746.JavaMail.mark@MARK%3E)<br/>
[INFO]   maven-surefire-plugin .................................. 2.10 -&gt; 2.11<br/>
