                                            <td class="customfield_12312920"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312327"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312921"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312720"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312324"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312325"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310192">      Previous versions of Avro&#39;s Java library allowed String and Java Enum values to be used in the Generic API when writing fields that are Avro Enums. This change makes the Generic API strict by requiring GenericEnumSymbol instances. To ease updating downstream projects it also adds a constructor for GenericData.EnumSymbol that calls toString on a passed Object.
  </td>
