                                            <td class="description">      The Avro tools-jar isn&#39;t going to work in the class path of most projects, since it has all of the dependencies inside of it like SLF4J. I know that SLF4J works fine with warning in case of multiple warning but still is there any way to get to fix issue? <br/>
I am using only one ReflectionToStringBuilder class from avro-tools.jar file. FYI
